ment","serviceType":"Skin Correction"},{"@type":"Service","name":"Melasma Treatment","serviceType":"Skin Correction"},{"@type":"Service","name":"Pore Extraction","serviceType":"Skin Correction"},{"@type":"Service","name":"Skin Analysis","serviceType":"Consultation"},{"@type":"Service","name":"3D Skin Analysis","serviceType":"Consultation"},{"@type":"Service","name":"Spa Packages","serviceType":"Spa"}],"slogan":"Timeless Beauty, Elevated Self-Care","foundingDate":"2025","founder":{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/about-us#cassia","name":"Cassia Monalize Da Silva Zablonski","givenName":"Cassia","familyName":"Zablonski","jobTitle":"Owner, Founder & Licensed Esthetician","description":"Cassia is a licensed esthetician and the owner and founder of Vitalis Luxe Spa in Medford, MA, with professional esthetic experience spanning Europe and the United States. Born and raised in Brazil and having spent a significant part of her career practicing in Europe, she brings a rich blend of international training, global aesthetics, and artistry to her work in New England. She specializes in personalized microneedling, chemical peels, and treatments for melasma and hyperpigmentation, and is fluent in English, Portuguese, Italian, and Spanish.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/about-us","image":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/69b5e17f03b46c743fcc2c6c/fa3a6734-14ef-4685-9ac4-276e19be0d19/cassia-owner-vitalis-luxe-spa.png?format=2500w","sameAs":["https://www.instagram.com/bycassiazablonski"],"knowsLanguage":["English","Portuguese","Italian","Spanish"],"hasCredential":[{"@type":"EducationalOccupationalCredential","credentialCategory":"license","name":"Licensed Esthetician","recognizedBy":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Massachusetts Board of Cosmetology and Barbering"},"identifier":"7231994"},{"@type":"EducationalOccupationalCredential","credentialCategory":"experienceRequirement","name":"International Professional Esthetic Practice","description