<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What services does Vitalis Luxe Spa offer?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Vitalis Luxe Spa offers a full range of advanced skin treatments including facials, microneedling, dermaplaning, RF skin tightening, chemical peels, enzymatic peels, facial massage, lymphatic drainage, nanoneedling, mesotherapy, LED light therapy, dermabrasion, and comprehensive skin analysis using 3D imaging technology."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where is Vitalis Luxe Spa located?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Vitalis Luxe Spa is located at 151 Mystic Ave, Medford, MA 02155. We serve clients from across the greater Boston area including Cambridge, Somerville, Arlington, Malden, Melrose, Stoneham, Woburn, Wakefield, Winchester, Revere, Chelsea, Waltham, Newton, Brookline, and surrounding communities."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I book an appointment at Vitalis Luxe Spa?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Appointments can be booked online at https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/book, by calling us at (617) 500-5515, or by emailing info@vitalisluxespa.com. We are open Monday through Friday 8:30 AM to 6:00 PM and Saturday 8:30 AM to 12:00 PM."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is microneedling and what skin concerns does it treat?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Microneedling is a professional skin rejuvenation treatment that uses fine, sterile needles to create controlled micro-channels in the skin, stimulating the body's natural collagen and elastin production. At Vitalis Luxe Spa, microneedling effectively treats fine lines, wrinkles, acne scars, enlarged pores, uneven skin texture, stretch marks, and overall skin dullness. We offer several microneedling options including treatments infused with hyaluronic acid, triple peptides, collagen, or combined with a customized chemical peel for enhanced results."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the difference between dermaplaning and dermabrasion?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Dermaplaning uses a sterile medical-grade blade to gently remove dead skin cells and fine facial hair (peach fuzz) from the surface of the skin, instantly revealing smoother, brighter skin and improving product absorption. Dermabrasion is a deeper mechanical exfoliation that uses a specialized device to resurface the skin, targeting texture irregularities, congestion, and dullness more intensively. Both treatments are available at Vitalis Luxe Spa and can be recommended based on your skin type and goals."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is microneedling safe for sensitive skin?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Microneedling can be performed on sensitive skin when customized appropriately. At Vitalis Luxe Spa, our estheticians conduct a thorough skin analysis before every treatment to assess your skin type, sensitivity, and concerns. Needle depth, speed, and infusion ingredients are all adjusted to suit your individual needs. We recommend a consultation or our complimentary skin analysis prior to booking microneedling for the first time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much do facials cost at Vitalis Luxe Spa?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Facial prices at Vitalis Luxe Spa range from $80 to $120 depending on the treatment. Our VITALIS Glow Express Facial starts at $80, the Mesotherapy Rejuvenation Facial and RF Skin Tightening Facial are $100, and the VITALIS Signature Radiance Facial is $120. A complimentary skin analysis is available to help determine the best treatment for your skin."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does microneedling cost at Vitalis Luxe Spa?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Microneedling at Vitalis Luxe Spa starts at $180 for our standard treatment with hyaluronic acid infusion. Enhanced microneedling sessions with triple peptides, collagen infusion, or a combined chemical peel are priced at $230. Our Nanoneedling Lip Infusion is available for $90. A series of treatments is recommended for optimal results."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of chemical peels does Vitalis Luxe Spa offer?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Vitalis Luxe Spa offers a range of professional chemical peels customized to your skin type and concerns. Our menu includes the VITALIS Enzymatic Glow Peel ($100), which uses naturally derived fruit enzymes for a gentle, radiance-boosting treatment with no downtime, and the VITALIS Radiant Renewal Chemical Peel ($120), a customized acid-based peel targeting uneven tone, fine lines, congestion, discoloration, and acne. We work with glycolic, lactic, salicylic, and enzymatic peel formulations depending on your skin's needs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is RF skin tightening and how does it work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Radiofrequency (RF) skin tightening is a non-invasive treatment that uses controlled RF energy to gently heat the deeper layers of the skin, stimulating the production of collagen and elastin. This process firms and tightens lax skin, softens fine lines and wrinkles, and improves overall tone and texture — all without surgery or downtime. At Vitalis Luxe Spa, our VITALIS RF Skin Tightening Facial focuses on the cheeks, jawline, and under-chin area, and is priced at $100."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What should I expect during my first visit to Vitalis Luxe Spa?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Your first visit to Vitalis Luxe Spa begins with a thorough consultation and skin analysis to understand your skin type, concerns, and goals. Our estheticians will recommend the most appropriate treatments and build a personalized skincare plan for you. The spa offers complimentary parking, wheelchair accessibility, and a welcoming waiting area with water, coffee, tea, and snacks. We accept all major credit cards, Apple Pay, Google Pay, and Buy Now Pay Later options."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Vitalis Luxe Spa treat acne and acne scars?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Vitalis Luxe Spa specializes in acne treatment facials and acne scar reduction. Our estheticians use a combination of deep cleansing, gentle exfoliation, professional extractions, targeted masks, and calming ingredients to reduce active breakouts, unclog pores, balance oil production, and help fade post-acne marks. Microneedling and chemical peels are also highly effective for improving the appearance of acne scarring and are available as part of a customized treatment plan."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is mesotherapy and what does it treat?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Mesotherapy is an advanced skin rejuvenation technique that delivers a customized cocktail of vitamins, antioxidants, hyaluronic acid, and rejuvenating ingredients directly into the superficial layers of the skin using precise micro-delivery methods. At Vitalis Luxe Spa, the VITALIS Mesotherapy Rejuvenation Facial ($100) is ideal for clients seeking deep hydration, improved skin tone and elasticity, and a visible reduction in dullness and early signs of aging."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What payment methods does Vitalis Luxe Spa accept?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Vitalis Luxe Spa accepts cash, check, Visa, MasterCard, American Express, Discover, debit cards, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Samsung Pay, gift cards, and Buy Now Pay Later financing options."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the hours of operation at Vitalis Luxe Spa?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Vitalis Luxe Spa is open Monday through Friday from 8:30 AM to 6:00 PM, and Saturday from 8:30 AM to 12:00 PM. We are closed on Sundays. To book an appointment, visit https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/book or call (617) 500-5515."}}]}</script>
